  "description": "Lydia Evanzi’s first life ends in tragedy because of one reason: her awful taste in men! Vowing to stay single in this life, Lydia chooses the chaste path as a priestess, though it’s really just a front for her to get revenge on all those who once wronged her. But to help with that plan comes another man, Arsen Edith, who actually proves to be a far better partner than Lydia hopes for...!\n\n(Tappytoon)",
